{"ASK_ADVICE","",{"Drink water, stay out of sight... that's the nice version of it","Be careful, then... and yeah, I know how that sounds","Okay, some folks have to learn it their own way, most do, come to that","Then I'll save it for somebody who asks me twice","Alright, just don't come back and tell me nobody warned you","Advice from a stranger's worth what you paid for it, so fair","Then good luck to you, I mean that, I ain't being smart about it"}},
{"ASK_DEN","",{"Good, that's the smartest thing anybody's said to me all day","Then keep off Tanner Road, and we never had this conversation","I'd not go either, and I got more reason than you","Then don't ask where they are, knowing makes folks curious and curious buries 'em","Good, somebody in this county should live long enough to get old","Okay, I won't think less of you - I ain't going either"}},
{"ASK_DEN","world=trees",{"Then keep walking and don't look at the tree line - that's my whole advice"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","",{"Then listen close, head, hard, once - if you have to do it twice you started wrong","Then don't start with your hands - find eight feet of anything and start with that","Then here's the truth, you'll freeze the first time - everybody does, plan on it","Then don't, walk off, you only got the one body","Alright, temple, not the forehead - front of a skull's thicker than you'd believe"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","world=fence",{"Alright, get behind something first, a chain link fence turns a nightmare into a chore"}},
{"ASK_HOW_KILL","world=door",{"One at a time, in a doorway, and never let one get around behind you"}},
{"ASK_MILITARY","",{"Probably better, wanting them to come is its own kind of trouble","Then just don't walk up on a roadblock in the dark and you'll do fine","Good, plan like nobody's coming and you'll never once be disappointed","Then I'll keep it, it ain't a story that's helped anybody sleep yet","Okay, I'd rather not say it out loud again anyhow","Fair, keep clear of anything green and keep your hands where they can see 'em"}},
{"ASK_MILITARY","world=road",{"Fine by me, talking don't change what's parked across that road"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","world=road",{"Suit yourself - don't stop for anybody waving on the road, that's all you need"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","hour=16,22",{"Fine, short version - be somewhere else at dusk"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","",{"Alright, then I'll leave it at be careful, which ain't much, I know","Good, some things you can't unhear, and I'd rather not be the one that said 'em","Then I'll shut up about it, head down, lights off, and you'll likely be fine","Fair, I wouldn't want it either - go on, then","Okay, just know friendly costs more out here than mean does"}},
{"ASK_SAFE_ZONE","",{"Then all I'll say is don't hand anybody your only way out","Fine, you'll find out or you won't, both of those happen to people","Good, places like that eat anybody who turns up needing something","Then don't go, honestly, that's the version I'd pick for myself","Keep moving and keep your own water, that's the only safe zone there is","Alright, I've said more about it than I meant to anyway","Ask me again when you get desperate, you probably will"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"No pressure, no pressure, sorry I asked","No? That's fine, that's totally fine"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Alright, your loss","Suit yourself, I'll keep my stuff"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Well, that's alright, dear"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Alright, no trade today, no hard feelings"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Copy"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Your loss, {g:pal|lady}"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","hour=7,18",{"Then quit wasting daylight on me"}},
{"ASK_TRADE","",{"Come back when your bag's heavier","Ain't nobody around here got two nickels to rub together, so I get it","Then we're just talking, I don't mind - say so up front though","Okay, I'd say the same in your boots","Then move on, there's folks behind you who brought something with 'em","Alright, keep what you've got - hanging onto it is its own kind of smart"}},
{"ASK_WHY_HOSTILE","",{"Then quit asking and start walking, that's the deal I'm offering you","Good, some answers make it worse, this here is one of them","Keep your distance and neither of us has to find out","Then we're done here - go on, I ain't saying it again","Smart - Curiosity's expensive out here and you ain't got the money for it","Fine, let's both call it a misunderstanding and walk in opposite directions"}},
