{"COME_WITH_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, I get it... good luck, honest","No? Alright, but if you change your mind, I'll be here"}},
{"COME_WITH_ME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Your call, I won't force you","Fine, I'll go alone, it's nothing new"}},
