{"COME_WITH_ME","",{"Then I'm staying, no hard feelings - watch that bend past the bridge","Figured as much - go on, then","Then we're done talking about it - take some water before you go","Fair, I wouldn't agree to it either, honestly","Then I stay put, somebody's got to be here if he comes back","Okay, don't come back sore about it, you asked and I answered you","Then go on, I've said my piece and I ain't saying it twice"}},
{"GENERIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"No? Oh... yeah, alright","O-oh no... I mean, oh, sorry, I shouldn't have asked","No, right, no, of course, I'd say no too","Okay... okay, fair, sorry, I'm a little raw today","T-that's, uh, that's alright, I'm not upset, I'm just, never mind","No? Okay, I'll, uh, I'll find another way","Hmm, no, yeah, no, forget I said anything!","No pressure, none, forget I asked","Sorry- I get ahead of myself, no is fine","Oh -- I see, I see, thanks for being honest!","Right, no, I figured, I just had to ask","No... of course... I'm sorry for bothering you","It's okay, really, it's okay, I'm fine","Alright, at least you told me straight","A no, then, I guess that's that","I just... I really hoped you'd say yes","No problem, no problem, none at all","Mm... okay, I'll keep that in mind","Alright, I won't push","S-sorry I asked, sorry, sorry","T-that's okay... it's just been a long week","Thanks anyway, at least you're honest","Okaaay, I deserved that, probably!","Ouch, but okay, ouch","Oh, okay, I'll just, I'll stand over here","I'll get over it, I always do","No worries, no worries, truly","Fine, I'll figure something out","You know what? That's fine, good for you for saying it","Right -- I won't take it personally, I'll try not to","Oh... oh, okay, I was afraid of that, never mind then","No? Okay, okay, that's alright, forget I asked","Right, no, of course, no, I shouldn't have asked, sorry","Sorry, didn't mean to put you on the spot","That's okay, honestly, it's okay, I wasn't sure anyway","Oh, well, I'll live, I've survived worse"}},
{"GENERIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"A no's a no... ok","Alright, noted, we'll leave it there","Suit yourself, no hard feelings","Figured as much... but thanks for answering","Fine, I won't ask twice","Understood, nothing more to say","That's your right, I won't argue","Clear enough, at least it's honest","Then that's that, we move on","No skin off my back","Right, one less thing to worry about","I'll take a no over a lie any day","Your call, your call entirely","Alright... don't lose sleep over it...","Mm, thought so, no problem","Straightforward, I like that","Good to know where we stand","Then we're agreed to disagree","Figured as much. Don't lose sleep over it","Well... I asked, and you answered..","Okay... forget I mentioned it...","That's decent of you, to say it plain","Alright, that settles it","No worries, no hurt, no harm","So be it","We'll leave it be, then","It was worth a try, that's all","Well, onward I guess","Not a problem, truly","Understood, and respected","Alright, I'll find another way","Doesn't matter to me either way","Suit yourself, I just figured I'd ask","No problem, no hard feelings","Mm, not what I hoped, but I'll live","Too bad, but thanks for the honesty","No? Hell, I should've known"}},
{"GENERIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Aw, that's alright, honey, I understand completely","No? That's okay, we can still be friends","Oh, don't feel bad, really, don't","That's fine, I'm not mad, I'm just a little sad","No problem, my friend, we can try again another time","It's okay, it was just a thought","Don't worry about it, I'll be here if you change your mind","I get it, I'm not mad","Sure, no pressure at all!","You're allowed to say no, you always are","Hey, no hard feelings, none at all","We'll leave it then, but door's open if you change your mind"}},
{"GENERIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fine, I didn't want you to say yes anyway","Good, because I wasn't really asking","No? Then we're done here","That's what I thought","Whatever you say","Of course you'd say that","Right, noted, and I'll remember","Then don't waste my time!!","Your loss, not mine!","Fine, but don't expect a second chance!"}},
