{"GIVE_BACK","",{"Didn't think so - go on, then, before somebody changes their mind about you","Then quit asking, asking twice for something you won't fight for is just noise","Good, that's the answer that keeps you breathing today","Then it's mine now, that's how this works and you already knew that","Alright, here, take it, I don't want it bad enough to watch you cry over it","Then walk, and be grateful, there's folks out here who don't offer twice","Smart, you'll get another one of them - you won't get another you"}},
