{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"N-no? Oh God, please, please just go, I'm begging you","Please -- I don't want any trouble, please!","Why won't you go? What do you want?","I'm scared -- I'm really scared, please leave","Fine, I'll go then, you stay","Don't make me do something I don't want to do","Please, I'm asking nicely, I'm asking so nicely","You're making this harder than it has to be","O-oh no -- oh no, what do I do?","What do you want from me?","I'm sorry, but you have to go!!","Please, I have people to protect","I can't have you here, I just can't","W-why are you doing this?","Please, just go, please","No?! Please, please, I'm asking nicely, please leave","Oh God, why won't you just go?"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Then we have a problem","Don't push me, I mean it","I asked once... nicely","I won't ask again","You're testing my patience","Leave, or I'll make you","Don't make this ugly","Last chance, friend..","That's not an option...","You're not helping yourself","Go, now","I mean it","Don't make me regret being polite","I'm warning you","Time to go... that's all","No? Then I'm moving, you stay if you want","Then I'll be the one to leave"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Please, friend, I don't want to fight you","I'm asking as a friend, please go","Don't make this hard!","It's not personal, please","Please understand"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Then I'll make you","Last warning","Go, or else!!","I'm done being nice"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"You've got a lot of nerve staying here after I asked, you know that?"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dear, please, I'm asking you to go"}},
{"LEAVE_NOW","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Last chance, leave now or face consequences"}},
