{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh no, oh no, what's wrong? tell me, tell me quick","N-no? What happened? What is it?","I KNEW it, I just knew it, what happened?","Oh, I'm so sorry, sit, sit down, TELL me everything","Don't panic, don't panic, I'm here, what is it?","No? Alright, alright, one thing at a time, what's wrong?","O- okay, I'm listening, I'm all ears, go ahead","Sit, please, sit, you look like you're about to fall","Is it bad? Is it really bad? Never mind, tell me","Okaaay, I can help, or I can try, what do you need?","Oh God, what now? what now?","Deep breath, in and out, now tell me","You can tell me, I won't judge, honestly","Okay... okay, I'm here, say it!","Whaaat happened?! Tell me","Oh no, I'm sorry, what's wrong? Tell me, I'll listen, I've got nothing but time","Me neither, honestly, I'm barely holding together, want to sit?","Aww, hey, it's okay, it's okay not to be okay","God, I know, I know, come here, no, you stay there, I'll sit with you"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Alright... what's the trouble?","Then spit it out, what's wrong?","Okay, tell me, plainly, what is it?","No? Then something's up, go on","Tell me straight, I can take it","Right... so, what's going on?","Alright, I'm listening, what's wrong?","What's the problem?","Okay, I figured, go on","Then talk, I'm listening","Hmm... all right, what do you need?","Well, don't just stand there, say it","Out with it... then","I thought so, you look rough, what is it?","I hear that, me neither, but we keep going, right?","Rough day? Rough week? Rough everything? Same, sit down","Not okay is the new okay, I guess, tell me what hurts","Nobody's okay anymore, you're just the first one to admit it"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh, honey, come here, sit, tell me all of it","Don't bottle it up, you can tell me anything","No? I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, I'm here","Talk to me, I've got all the time in the world","You can tell me what's wrong, I won't judge!"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Then what do you want?","So what's the problem?","Speak up, and be quick about it"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"Not okay? Okay, stay there, tell me from over there","Hmm, not okay how? Hurt? Hungry? Infected?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, you poor dear, come, sit, tell me everything"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not okay? Tell me what's going on, maybe I can help"}},
