{"NPC_OPEN","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Understood, how can I assist?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"State the problem"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not okay, huh? Welcome to the club, want a drink?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Not my problem, kid"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","",{"Yeah... I hear you - tell me what's wrong - or don't, I won't push","Shit, hurt, hungry, or just all of it? Ask me what you need - I can't promise I've got it","Me neither, honestly, we don't have to pretend for a minute","Take a breath, you're here, you're talking - start with that","I'm sorry, I don't have some big speech, I can listen, though","Alright, one thing at a time - what do you need to know?","No, I didn't figure - sit down and start with the worst part","Alright, you don't have to perform for me - what do you need?","Nobody's doing good, whole county's the same way, talk if it helps any","Hell, okay - hungry, hurt, or the other thing?","I hear you, I won't tell you it gets better - ask me something useful instead","Copy - sit down before you fall down - then talk","Yeah, me neither, most days - say what you came for","Okay, I've got water and a bad attitude - which do you want first?","I know, I can hear it - take a minute, I ain't going anywhere just yet"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","hour=7,18",{"Then don't stand out in the sun about it - come in the shade"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh thank God, thank God, I thought- never mind, thank God","Phew, okay, okay, that's good, that's good news"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Then let me see your arms, just to be sure","But I'm going to check anyway, no offense"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bless the Lord, come here, let me look at you"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Show me your arms, slowly, to confirm"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Verify, roll up your sleeves"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Prove it, take your shirt off"}},
{"PLAYER_BITTEN","",{"Then I have to keep my distance - I'm sorry, that ain't me thinking less of you","Then I'll take your word, standing right about here while I do","Okay, your business - don't come in the house and I won't ask you twice","Then go somewhere you want to be, and go while you can still walk","Then there's nothing I can do, I wish there was, I've wished that nine times now","Alright, I won't push at you - sit in the shade at least, that much I can do","Then I'm stepping back... don't follow me, please, don't follow me"}},
{"SHARE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh... alright, I understand","No? That's fine, you've got to look after yourself","Sorry, sorry, I shouldn't have offered","I figured you might be wary, that's fair","I- it's okay -- more for me, I guess, I'm joking","Alright... no pressure, no pressure at all","Yeah, I'd say no too","Okay, thanks anyway","I hope you find a good meal somewhere!","T-that's your choice... and I respect it","Never mind -- forget it","Right, I'll put it AWAY","No problem, no problem","Fine, I won't force it","It's okay, truly","No, no, you keep it, you need it more, honestly, I'm fine","I couldn't, but thank you, thank you so much for offering","No, no, no, keep it, you need it more than I do, honestly","No, thanks, I'm okay, really, save it for yourself"}},
{"SHARE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Suit yourself","More for me... then","Your loss, it's good stew","Fine, I won't insist","No harm, no foul","Alright, I'll save it..","Then I'll eat it myself","Understood, no offense","Pride makes a poor supper, but it's yours","It was an honest offer","Okay, nothing lost","Well, the offer stands","No worries","Yeah... yeah, ok","Alright, don't starve out of principle","Nah, I've got my own, save yours","I'm good, thanks, you hold on to that","Nah, keep it, you'll need it before I do","I'm good, thanks, I've got my own"}},
{"SHARE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"That's all right, friend, the offer stands!!","Alright, but if you change your mind, say so","No pressure, my friend, none at all","Another time, then, I'll keep a plate warm","You're always welcome at my table"}},
{"SHARE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fine, I only asked to be polite!","Good, I didn't want to share anyway","Your loss","Then STOP looking at it like that"}},
{"SHARE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"No, I don't take food from strangers","Keep it, I'm not hungry, I don't trust you"}},
